<title>FINLAND: YIT SAYS TO BUILD FIM 120 MLN OFFICE.</title>
<headline>YIT SAYS TO BUILD FIM 120 MLN OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group YIT-Yhtyma Oy said on Thursday it would start a 120 million markka commercial property and office building project in Helsinki this spring.</p>
<p>&quot;The building work will begin in spring 1997 and the building will be completed in spring 1998. The value of the project is about 120 million markka,&quot; YIT-Yhtyma said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
